%N A126406 Number of base 19 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by two or less.
%C A126406 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1) for base>=2n-1; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1)-2 when base=2n-2
%H A126406 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126406 <a href="/index/Rec#order_10">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (11,-35,7,104,-61,-91,50,26,-8,-2).
%o A126406 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>2)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>2))
